%
% Lewis (credulous): {blue, green} are incomparable -> two closest worlds. The
% credulous quantifier returns φ that holds in SOME closest world -> the union
% {blue, green}, instead of the deterministic profile's "unknown".
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/worlds-c/lewis/').
:- counterfactual(ex:cf, ex:base).
:- assume(ex:flag(ex:x, ex:blue)).
:- assume(ex:flag(ex:x, ex:green)).
?- ex:flag(ex:x, Z).
